Most of this directory is the isopacks icon set (MIT, Copyright 2023 Mark
Mankarious) -- see ISOPACKS_LICENSE. Those files are unmodified.

FOUR FILES ARE NOT FROM ISOPACKS:

    camera.svg
    speaker.svg
    gameconsole.svg
    sensor.svg

isopacks covers none of these subjects; no SVG in any of its collections does.
These four are derived from the UniFi icon set bundled under
../icons-unifi/ (MIT, Copyright 2026 Merlijn Tishauser -- see
../icons-unifi/LICENSE), restyled into the isopacks blue palette by
scripts/recolour_icons.py. Geometry is unchanged from that set; only fill and
stroke colours differ.

They replaced primitive-built stand-ins that did not match the surrounding
artwork. The isopacks copyright does not extend to them, and the UniFi set's
licence and trademark statement do.
